[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3963.47, "timestamp": "01:06:03", "text": "之前，我的意思是，在我之前，嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3971.349, "timestamp": "01:06:11", "text": "我当时被一个箱子吸引住了，然后我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3980.23, "timestamp": "01:06:20", "text": "哦，好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3984.15, "timestamp": "01:06:24", "text": "好吧，你为什么看到旁边那些皮肤？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3987.23, "timestamp": "01:06:27", "text": "呃，末日博士，哦耶，就是这个，对，就是这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.47, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "一、是啊，这确实挺老的了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3992.109, "timestamp": "01:06:32", "text": "我想我们开始尝试的就是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3996.19, "timestamp": "01:06:36", "text": "时间到了，或者好吧，你需要买东西。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3997.212, "timestamp": "01:06:37", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "herro"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3997.71, "timestamp": "01:06:37", "text": "正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4001.029, "timestamp": "01:06:41", "text": "那我们就去这儿吧，希望没人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4003.029, "timestamp": "01:06:43", "text": "他们会比我们先到那里，我发誓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4004.51, "timestamp": "01:06:44", "text": "天哪，如果我比兄弟先到，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4006.19, "timestamp": "01:06:46", "text": "露营"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4019.589, "timestamp": "01:06:59", "text": "另外，我正在吃晚饭，不，不"}]